    <!-- About & Rules (AboutActivity) -->
    <string name="about_rules_title">Gomoku Tactics Rules</string>
    <string name="about_rules_body">• Two players take turns placing X and O pieces on empty cells of a 15x15, 20x20, or 30x30 board.\n• The first player to form an unbroken line of 5 pieces horizontally, vertically, or diagonally wins.\n• When Block Two Ends is enabled, a 5-piece line blocked at both ends by opponent pieces does not count as a win.\n• Pinch-to-zoom and pan gestures are supported for large boards.</string>
    <string name="about_app_info_title">About the Application</string>
    <string name="about_app_info_body">Gomoku Tactics features a multi-tier Grandmaster AI engine (VCF/VCT solver, PVS, Zobrist Hashing), local 2-player mode, real-time 6-digit room Online multiplayer, and full match Replay history.</string>
